  {
    "name": "Update",
    "desc": "This capability gathers the verify routine of the current Type and all ancestor types of that Type and runs them; for the ones that return true, select the most-specialized Type and run Identify.  Use that data to Update the current entity. Update in this case means: adjust instanceOf Type relation and update Node properties with identified data.",
    "meta": {
